<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Mew & Maple with editorial feedback, a correction or a question about the website and its privacy practices.">
<section class="container prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</p><h1>A note to Mew &amp; Maple</h1><p>For editorial feedback, corrections or questions about this website, email <a href="mailto:samigrowlab@gmail.com">samigrowlab@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>Suggest a correction</h2><p>Include the page link, the passage you are asking about and a supporting source if you have one. We will review the information before making changes.</p><h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>You can use the same email address for privacy questions and requests. Please avoid including unnecessary sensitive information.</p><h2>Questions about your cat</h2><p>We cannot provide individual veterinary advice. Contact your veterinarian for health concerns or sudden changes in your cat's behavior.</p><p>We use email rather than a website contact form. Your email service and the receiving email provider process messages under their own privacy practices.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
